<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" class="scroll-smooth">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>CEELEX - Centro de Enseñanza de Lenguas Extranjeras - <%= title %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Sans:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            body: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
            headline: ['PT Sans', 'sans-serif'],
          },
          colors: {
            background: 'hsl(165 60% 97%)',
            foreground: 'hsl(171 80% 10%)',
            card: 'hsl(165 60% 97%)',
            'card-foreground': 'hsl(171 80% 10%)',
            popover: 'hsl(165 60% 97%)',
            'popover-foreground': 'hsl(171 80% 10%)',
            primary: 'hsl(171 95% 27%)',
            'primary-foreground': 'hsl(171 25% 95%)',
            secondary: 'hsl(169 53% 90%)',
            'secondary-foreground': 'hsl(171 95% 27%)',
            muted: 'hsl(169 53% 94%)',
            'muted-foreground': 'hsl(171 40% 30%)',
            accent: 'hsl(169 53% 41%)',
            'accent-foreground': 'hsl(171 25% 98%)',
            destructive: 'hsl(0 84.2% 60.2%)',
            'destructive-foreground': 'hsl(0 0% 98%)',
            border: 'hsl(171 20% 88%)',
            input: 'hsl(171 20% 88%)',
            ring: 'hsl(171 95% 27%)',
          },
          borderRadius: {
            lg: '0.5rem',
            md: 'calc(0.5rem - 2px)',
            sm: 'calc(0.5rem - 4px)',
          },
        },
      },
    }
  </script>
</head>

<body class="font-body antialiased bg-background text-foreground">
  <%- include("./templates/header.ejs", { navigationLinks: navigationLinks, title: title }) %>

  <%- include("./templates/page_header.ejs", { 
    pageTitle: "CEELEX",
    pageDescription: "Centro de Enseñanza de Lenguas Extranjeras - Domina nuevos idiomas y amplía tus oportunidades",
    breadcrumbs: [
      { title: "Inicio", href: "/" },
      { title: "Servicios", href: "#" },
      { title: "CEELEX", href: null }
    ],
    heroImage: heroImage
  }) %>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Introduction -->
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          El Centro de Enseñanza de Lenguas Extranjeras (CEELEX) de la Universidad Tecnológica de Nayarit 
          ofrece programas de idiomas de alta calidad para estudiantes, profesionistas y público en general, 
          con el objetivo de desarrollar competencias lingüísticas que potencien el desarrollo profesional y académico.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Languages Offered -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8 text-center">Idiomas que Ofrecemos</h2>
        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          
          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 mx-auto">
              <span class="text-3xl">🇬🇧</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-center">Inglés</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-center">
              Niveles básico, intermedio y avanzado con certificación internacional
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 mx-auto">
              <span class="text-3xl">🇫🇷</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-center">Francés</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-center">
              Cursos desde nivel A1 hasta C1 según Marco Común Europeo
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 mx-auto">
              <span class="text-3xl">🇩🇪</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-center">Alemán</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-center">
              Programas intensivos y regulares con instructores certificados
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 mx-auto">
              <span class="text-3xl">🇮🇹</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-center">Italiano</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-center">
              Aprende el idioma de la cultura, el arte y la gastronomía
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 mx-auto">
              <span class="text-3xl">🇵🇹</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-center">Portugués</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-center">
              Domina el idioma más hablado de América Latina
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 mx-auto">
              <span class="text-3xl">🇯🇵</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-center">Japonés</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-center">
              Introducción al idioma y cultura japonesa
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Features Section -->
      <div class="bg-secondary/50 rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12 mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8 text-center">Nuestras Ventajas</h2>
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-foreground">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5">
                  <path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/>
                  <path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Profesores Certificados</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                Docentes con certificaciones internacionales y amplia experiencia
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-foreground">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5">
                  <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
                  <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
                  <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
                  <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Grupos Reducidos</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                Máximo 15 alumnos por grupo para atención personalizada
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-foreground">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5">
                  <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/>
                  <path d="M3 9h18"/>
                  <path d="M9 21V9"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Horarios Flexibles</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                Turnos matutino, vespertino y sabatino
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-foreground">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5">
                  <path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/>
                  <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Certificación Oficial</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                Constancias y certificados con validez internacional
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-foreground">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5">
                  <rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="7" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                  <path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Instalaciones Modernas</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                Aulas equipadas con tecnología multimedia
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-foreground">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                  <path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"/>
                  <path d="M2 12h20"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-1">Material Didáctico</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                Libros y recursos digitales incluidos en la inscripción
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Course Modalities -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8 text-center">Modalidades de Estudio</h2>
        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
          
          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-primary p-6 text-center">
              <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl font-semibold text-primary-foreground">Presencial</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <ul class="space-y-3">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">Clases en instalaciones de la universidad</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">Interacción directa con profesores</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">Práctica conversacional en grupo</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">2 a 4 horas semanales</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-accent p-6 text-center">
              <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl font-semibold text-accent-foreground">En Línea</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <ul class="space-y-3">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">Clases vía videoconferencia</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">Plataforma educativa 24/7</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">Flexibilidad de horarios</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">Recursos multimedia interactivos</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-secondary p-6 text-center">
              <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl font-semibold text-secondary-foreground">Híbrido</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <ul class="space-y-3">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">Combina presencial y en línea</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">Lo mejor de ambas modalidades</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">Mayor flexibilidad</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm">Ideal para profesionistas ocupados</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA Section -->
      <div class="text-center bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-accent rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary-foreground mb-4">
          Inscripciones Abiertas
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-primary-foreground/90 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Inicia tu camino hacia el dominio de un nuevo idioma. Contáctanos para conocer nuestros horarios y promociones.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="mailto:ceelex@utnay.edu.mx" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium h-11 px-8 bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-background/90">
            Solicitar Información
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+523112119800" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium h-11 px-8 border-2 border-primary-foreground text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary-foreground/10">
            Llamar Ahora
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include("./templates/footer.ejs", {title: title}) %>

</body>
</html>
